     def get(self, name: str) -> Any:
+        # Gio.DBusProxy already mirrors every property of this interface (it does
+        # an initial GetAll unless DO_NOT_LOAD_PROPERTIES is set, and keeps the
+        # mirror current from PropertiesChanged). Read from that cache instead of
+        # issuing a synchronous Properties.Get round trip per access: with a few
+        # thousand device objects in the bluez tree, an uncached read turns any
+        # `for d in manager.get_devices(): d['Address']` loop into thousands of
+        # blocking system-bus calls and pins a whole core (that is what made
+        # blueman-applet spin). Only skip the cache for a property we just wrote
+        # and bluez has not echoed back yet, and fall through to a live call when
+        # the cache does not know the property.
